sequenceDiagram
actor Agronomist as Agronomist
participant AgronomistDashboard as Boundary: AgronomistDashboard
participant FieldAssignmentReviewControl as Control: FieldAssignmentReviewControl
participant FieldAssignment as Entity: FieldAssignment
Agronomist->>+AgronomistDashboard: Request field evidence
AgronomistDashboard->>+FieldAssignmentReviewControl: Reload account and resolve assignments
FieldAssignmentReviewControl->>+FieldAssignment: Query scoped field relationship
FieldAssignment-->>-FieldAssignmentReviewControl: Return assigned identifiers
FieldAssignmentReviewControl-->>-AgronomistDashboard: Load permitted diagnosis and image
AgronomistDashboard-->>-Agronomist: Display assigned evidence only
